WEBVTT

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:04.961
[tires screeching]

00:00:10.926 --> 00:00:12.760
[Wolf sighs]

00:00:14.054 --> 00:00:15.597
We can't do this without him.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.891
He might be a Mr. Grumpypants.

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:21.269
But he's our Mr. Grumpypants.

00:00:21.353 --> 00:00:22.270
[Piranha] Yeah.

00:00:25.274 --> 00:00:26.733
Wolf!

00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:29.986
I'm starting to see why
your friends dumped you.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.113
I don't have any friends!

00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:33.948
- [horn honking]
- [Wolf] Snake! Snake!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.117
Wolf?

00:00:36.201 --> 00:00:37.577
Snake, come back!

00:00:37.661 --> 00:00:39.162
We need you, baby!

00:00:39.246 --> 00:00:40.830
[Tarantula] And you need us!

00:00:40.914 --> 00:00:45.084
Oh, there you go again,
making it personal.

00:00:45.169 --> 00:00:47.879
I'll give you one last chance
to give me the meteorite.

00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:50.590
Oh, yeah?
What you gonna do, Whiskers?

00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:53.134
- This.
- [helmet whirs]

00:00:53.218 --> 00:00:54.469
[Shark gasps]

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:55.845
What the...

00:01:01.018 --> 00:01:02.018
[chittering]

00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:04.854
- We've got adorable company.
- Floor it!

00:01:10.027 --> 00:01:11.069
[Wolf] Whoa!

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.865
Maybe I shouldn't have called him
"Whiskers."

00:01:21.497 --> 00:01:23.373
[gasping]

00:01:23.457 --> 00:01:27.210
When I woke up this morning,
this is not where I saw the day going.

00:01:27.294 --> 00:01:28.586
Whoa!

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:31.964
[Wolf] Come on!

00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:36.928
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Hey, hey,
let's dial this down a notch, huh?

00:01:37.012 --> 00:01:39.555
Besides, you'll never get him.
He's too good a driver.

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:42.517
Hmm. You're right.

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:43.893
But now that I think of it,

00:01:43.977 --> 00:01:46.437
maybe it would be better to exploit
his greatest weakness.

00:01:46.522 --> 00:01:48.147
Exactly.

00:01:48.232 --> 00:01:49.816
Wait.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.275
No!

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:55.238
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:01:55.322 --> 00:01:57.407
- Hold on, hold it, hold it, hold it.
- [laughing]

00:01:57.491 --> 00:01:59.200
Okay, okay. You win.

00:01:59.284 --> 00:02:00.993
You can have the space rock.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:02.870
Good boy, Wolf.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:04.497
[helmet whirs]

00:02:12.756 --> 00:02:14.257
[Wolf] Take the wheel.

00:02:14.341 --> 00:02:16.634
Not so fast! Pull him up first.

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:18.886
Or I'll use this.

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:20.638
Oh, come, now.

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:24.976
[Snake laughing]

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.353
Do it, or you'll lose the rock.

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:31.315
If you insist. Cuddles!

00:02:38.532 --> 00:02:39.866
You want him?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:40.950
He's yours.

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.119
[screams]

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:45.037
[screaming continues]

00:02:45.122 --> 00:02:46.456
Snake!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.166
- No, no, no!
- Snake!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.333
Oh, no!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:02.472
[Snake screaming]

00:03:02.556 --> 00:03:05.516
Guys, I know it's crazy,
but we're gonna jump it.

00:03:05.601 --> 00:03:08.186
Crazy? You finally speaking
my language, chico!

00:03:18.489 --> 00:03:21.491
We're gonna make it!

00:03:22.826 --> 00:03:23.868
[Piranha screaming]

00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:30.708
You came back.

00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:33.961
[Wolf grunting]

00:03:34.046 --> 00:03:35.129
Snake,

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:36.756
I should've been honest with you.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.218
I was afraid that if you knew
I wanted to be good, that you'd...

00:03:40.302 --> 00:03:42.678
Act like a jerk
and never talk to you again?

00:03:42.763 --> 00:03:44.597
[laughing] Yeah.

00:03:44.681 --> 00:03:46.557
Point is, I... [stammers]

00:03:46.642 --> 00:03:49.018
Yeah. I love you too, buddy.

00:03:53.774 --> 00:03:55.399
This... This is so beautiful.

00:03:55.484 --> 00:03:57.735
Do you know how beautiful this is,
you guys? [crying]

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:01.072
Now...
Now you gonna make me cry.

00:04:01.156 --> 00:04:02.448
I know.

00:04:02.533 --> 00:04:03.991
So pathetic, right?

00:04:04.076 --> 00:04:05.660
Come on, guys.

00:04:06.245 --> 00:04:07.954
Who said it was the end?

00:04:08.038 --> 00:04:09.205
- [all gasp]
- [Snake laughs]

00:04:12.334 --> 00:04:14.085
- [Piranha] Whoo-hoo!
- [Snake laughing]

00:04:14.837 --> 00:04:15.837
Gah!

00:04:22.761 --> 00:04:25.388
[Marmalade] No! Cuddles!
We're losing altitude!

00:04:25.472 --> 00:04:27.682
We're losing altitude! We're going down!

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:34.146
[gasps, coughs]

00:04:34.231 --> 00:04:36.065
What happened?
Did we blow up?

00:04:36.149 --> 00:04:37.149
Is this heaven?

00:04:39.903 --> 00:04:42.071
[Wolf grunting]

00:04:43.574 --> 00:04:44.991
[officers chattering]

00:04:47.202 --> 00:04:49.954
- [laughs] That is it.
- [Piranha] Hey!

00:04:50.038 --> 00:04:53.457
There is absolutely no way
you're getting away this time.

00:04:53.542 --> 00:04:54.667
Wait, Chief.

00:04:54.751 --> 00:04:56.002
Governor Foxington?

00:04:56.086 --> 00:04:57.169
- Don't do this.
- [Wolf] Ow!

00:04:57.254 --> 00:04:59.714
They didn't steal the meteorite.
They were bringing it back.

00:04:59.798 --> 00:05:02.133
Ha! How could you know that?

00:05:02.217 --> 00:05:03.676
Unless...

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.179
Unless you were conspiring
with a bunch of known criminals.

00:05:08.473 --> 00:05:09.932
Well... [clears throat]

00:05:10.642 --> 00:05:11.976
...as a matter of fact,

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:15.104
it's time I came clean about something.

00:05:16.356 --> 00:05:18.900
The truth is I'm really... [clears throat]

00:05:18.984 --> 00:05:22.236
-...really...
- Really a big fan of redemption arcs.

00:05:22.321 --> 00:05:23.404
Yeah, we know.

